{"id":"88eede408dae828a","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-truth-undefinable.md","title":"Truth Undefinable","display":"thm-truth-undefinable — Truth Undefinable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-truth-undefinable","aliases":["92-thm-truth-undefinable"],"display":"thm-truth-undefinable — Truth Undefinable","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 104–105（PDF 121–122）","source_status":"原书内部真谓词不可能性的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-truth-undefinable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-truth-undefinable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-undefinable — Truth Undefinable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 104–105（PDF 121–122）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内部真谓词不可能性的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic strength needed by the diagonal lemma)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (candidate internal truth formula and its distinguished free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function and capture-avoiding substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate for the full internal disquotation scheme)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}undefinable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(T)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\Bigr),\\\\\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}undefinable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(T)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\Bigr),\\\\\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)\\)</span>把“把句子码代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的自由变量”写成<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>中的三元无捕获代入；公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>不能被当作元语言函数直接应用</li>\n<li>这是“全部内部Tarski双条件均在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证”的不可能性；它与标准模型中的语义不可定义版本相关但并非同一断言</li>\n<li>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>下，若存在这样的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，对角引理给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner L\\urcorner},x)\">\\(G\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner L\\urcorner},x)\\)</span>；再与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>对应的双条件合用便与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>冲突</li>\n<li>单个真理层级可在更强元语言中形式化；不可行的是在同一算术语言中得到覆盖全部算术句子的自指真谓词</li>\n<li>标准内部可证性谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span>存在，但满足全部Tarski双条件的同层真谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>不存在</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是一致系统不能证明全部内部析引双条件的版本，和标准模型真集不可定义不同。取否定真谓词的内部固定点，与该句的析引实例合并得到矛盾。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 104–105（PDF 121–122）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false