tatus":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}undefinable}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nT\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(T)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\Bigr),\\\\\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow{}&\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthScheme}_G(T,x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner L\\urcorner},x)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":3237,"backlinks":[{"id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"保留 $\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)$ 的标准模型语义含义。原书第 VIII 章的 truth-predicate 则要求对每个句子 $X$，系统证明 $X\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})$，这正是[[92-thm-truth-undefinable]]所展开的内部析引模式；语义正确并不自动使所有双条件在 $G$ 中可证。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-truth-undefinable]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-truth-undefinable]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","c7befd96bd551ade","90f32e29c9d553ed","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","725c1f1651ce9a00","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","b78092e29a02d697","f3fdd55235f4984e","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}